<p>In the fourth quarter of fiscal 1997, the company recorded a one-time tax benefit of $2.7 million.  Excluding this one-time benefit, at an effective tax rate of 38 percent, net earnings for the fourth quarter of fiscal 1997 would have been $675, or $0.06 per share on a fully diluted basis.  For fiscal 1997, prior to the tax benefit, net earnings would have been $1,200, or $0.13 per share on a fully diluted basis.</p>
